    "raw_output": "```python\nimport csv\nimport io\nimport re\n\ndef encode_csv_field(value: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Serialize one RFC-4180-style field.\n    Return it unchanged unless it contains comma, double quote, CR, or LF;\n    then surround it with double quotes and double every embedded double quote.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(value, str):\n        return value\n    \n    # Check for special characters that require quoting\n    needs_quoting = (\n        ',' in value or\n        '\"' in value or\n        '\\r' in value or\n        '\\n' in value\n    )\n    \n    if not needs_quoting:\n        return value\n    \n    # Escape double quotes by doubling them\n    escaped_value = value.replace('\"', '\"\"')\n    \n    # Wrap in double quotes\n    return f'\"{escaped_value}\"'\n```<|im_end|>",
